 "description": "<p>Ten frequencies of tongue motion, ten of vibration-rotation, and a 500mA battery carrying the load — the Tide earns its name through the pairing of a lapping front and a rotating undercurrent. The tongue side sets the surface feel; the rotation underneath keeps the floor moving.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_6_a967f941-5b42-42b4-98a6-d8fec5b7be4d_480x480.jpg?v=1692238795\"><br />\n<img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_9_2e320925-86e9-4f2d-87e4-ded70ae81f0a_480x480.jpg?v=1692238803\"></p>\n<p>Silicone and ABS split the construction along the usual line, soft where it contacts and rigid where it works. The sub-50 dB ceiling keeps the dual-channel output inside quiet-apartment bounds, which matters more here than on single-motor toys: two channels running together is where noise usually spikes.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_9_2e320925-86e9-4f2d-87e4-ded70ae81f0a_480x480.jpg?v=1692238803\"></p>\n<p>Full waterproofing covers shower play and rinse cleaning, and the magnetic charger snaps home without alignment. Between the twenty settings and the sealed shell, it is built for regular duty rather than occasional ceremony.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_2_f98119cd-1778-4308-83c6-7bc8b8c4adf7_480x480.jpg?v=1692238785\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tongue modes: 10 frequencies</li>\n<li>Vibration-rotation modes: 10</li>\n<li>Battery: 500 mA</li>\n<li>Material: silicone + ABS</li>\n<li>Noise: under 50 dB</li>\n<li>Waterproof: fully sealed</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_1_4d4eb7b0-71d2-49b7-807e-b7fc09238ebe_480x480.jpg?v=1692238781\"></p>\n<p>Surface lap and rotating floor in one tide — twenty settings deep.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Tide rose vibrator with 10 tongue frequencies and 10 vibration-rotation modes, 500 mA battery, sub-50 dB motors and waterproof sealing.</p>\n",
